ed_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-07T14:19:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T15:08:34Z","closed_at":"2026-10-10T12:35:34Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.8-dev7 [c971f93e7]\n- Unreproducible in 4.8-dev6 [8898c2b3d], 4.7-stable, etc.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.8-dev7 - Vulkan/D3D (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe Godot-Motion-Blur-Addon (https://github.com/sphynx-owner/Godot-Motion-Blur-Addon) smears the background in 4.8-dev7 and NOT in 4.8-dev6 or 4.7-stable.\n\nI suspect this isn't an addon issue due to it effecting the background specifically (motion-blur works as expected on geometry) and the fact it works in dev6 without any related item in the dev7 changelog (that I can see at least).\n\n[Screenshot 1: Godot 4.8-dev6 - working as expected]\n<img width=\"1258\" height=\"1214\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee5d551d-90fa-411a-95b3-6d132a106a07\" />\n\n[Screenshot 2: Godot 4.8-dev7 - background is smeared]\n<img width=\"1336\" height=\"1228\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/756bc3d4-02be-4de7-95f2-250438c462dd\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download the included MRP or..\n - Create new project.\n - Add the [Easy-Compositor-Addon](https://github.com/sphynx-owner/Easy-Compositor-Addon)\n - Add the [Godot-Motion-Blur-Addon](https://github.com/sphynx-owner/Godot-Motion-Blur-Addon)\n - Make a new 3D scene, Add a WorldEnvironment to it and a Compositor with a `GuertinSphynxMotionBlur` element.\n\n2. Move the viewport around quickly to see that motion-blur is working or smeared.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-motion-blur.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33160720/test-motion-blur.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"PhilipWitte","id":1392440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTI0NDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1392440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipWitte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipWitte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124256/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}